Package: sfcqr
Type: Package
Title: Supervised Functional Censored Quantile Regression
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Package", "Maintainer", email = "maintainer@example.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits supervised functional censored quantile regression models
    with image basis expansions, inverse censoring probability weights,
    penalized quantile covariance dimension reduction, and integrated
    information criteria. Provides the manuscript's main simulation setting,
    smaller illustrative data,
    coefficient reconstruction, and prediction on new observations.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    quantreg (>= 6.1),
    survival,
    splines,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
